s=\"block\" href=\"/parent/join\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl font-semibold ring-offset-bg transition-all duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.98] border bg-transparent hover:bg-[#EFF6FF] h-12 px-7 w-full font-athletic uppercase tracking-wide min-h-[52px] text-base border-[#CBD5E1] text-slate-900\">Parent Access</button></a><a class=\"block\" href=\"/waitlist\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl font-semibold ring-offset-bg transition-all duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.98] border bg-transparent h-12 px-7 text-base w-full border-slate-300 text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-50 min-h-[48px]\">Coach or school access</button></a><a class=\"block\" href=\"/login\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl font-semibold ring-offset-bg transition-all duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.98] border bg-transparent h-12 min-h-[48px] px-7 text-base w-full border-slate-300 text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-50\">Sign In</button></a></div></div><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F8FAFC] via-white to-white py-14 md:py-20\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"absolute -top-24 -left-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[#3B82F6]/10 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[#60A5FA]/10 blur-3xl\"></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 relative z-10\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-athletic font-bold text-center mb-10 md:mb-12 text-[#212529] uppercase tracking-tight\">Privacy Policy</h1><div class=\"relative max-w-4xl mx-auto overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-neutral-900 p-8 md:p-10 text-[#E5E7EB] shadow-md space-y-6 leading-relaxed [&amp;_a]:text-[#93C5FD] [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-slate-100 [&amp;_h2]:text-xl [&amp;_h2]:font-athletic [&amp;_h2]:font-semibold [&amp;_h2]:uppercase [&amp;_h2]:tracking-wide [&amp;_h2]:text-[#3B82F6] [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:list-inside [&amp;_ul]:space-y-1\"><div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-[#3B82F6]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative space-y-6 pl-0\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-[#3B82F6]\">PRIVACY POLICY</p><p>Effective Date: March 22, 2026</p><p>Company: Apex Technical Solutions Group LLC</p><p>Product: Braik</p></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-athletic font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#3B82F6]\">1. Information We Collect</h2><p>We may collect:</p><p class=\"font-semibold\">Account Information</p><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1\"><li>Name</li><li>Email address</li><li>Mobile phone number (if you choose to provide it)</li><li>Role (Coach, Player, Parent)</li><li>Team affiliation</li></ul><p class=\"font-semibold\">Usage Data</p><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1\"><li>Login activity</li><li>Feature interactions</li><li>Messaging data</li><li>Uploaded content</li></ul><p class=\"font-semibold\">Payment Information</p><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1\"><li>Limited billing data via third-party processors</li></ul><p class=\"font-semibold\">AI Processing Data</p><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1\"><li>Documents submitted for analysis</li><li>Images uploaded for configuration</li><li>Practice schedules and spreadsheets</li></ul></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-athletic font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#3B82F6]\">2. How We Use Information</h2><p>We use data to:</p><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1\"><li>Provide team management services</li><li>Enable AI functionality</li><li>Improve platform features</li><li>Provide customer support</li><li>Maintain security</li></ul><p>We do not sell personal data.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-athletic font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#3B82F6]\">3. SMS Communications and Mobile Information</h2><p>If you voluntarily provide a mobile phone number, Braik may use it to send transactional SMS messages related to team participation and account activity—for example, team invitations, roster or schedule updates, and security or sign-in alerts. These messages are not sent for unrelated third-party marketing.</p><p>Message frequency varies based on your team&#x27;s activity. You can opt out of SMS at any time by replying STOP to a message. Standard message and data rates may apply depending on your carrier and plan.</p><p>Braik may use messaging service providers (such as carrier-connected SMS gateways) solely to deliver these communications. We do not sell SMS opt-in data, and we do not share it with third parties for their own marketing purposes. We may retain consent records (for example, time, method, and source of opt-in) for compliance, security, and operational purposes.</p><p>For full terms that apply when you opt in, see the<!-- --> <a class=\"text-[#60A5FA] underline hover:text-slate-100\" href=\"/terms\">Terms of Service</a>.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-athletic font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#3B82F6]\">4. Data Sharing</h2><p>We may share data:</p><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1\"><li>With payment processors</li><li>With cloud hosting providers</li><li>To comply with legal obligations</li></ul><p>We do not sell or rent user data to advertisers.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-athletic font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#3B82F6]\">5. Data Storage &amp; Retention</h2><p>Data is stored on secure cloud infrastructure.</p><p>We retain data:</p><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1\"><li>As long as an account is active</li><li>As required for legal compliance</li><li>Until user requests deletion (where applicable)</li></ul></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-athletic font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#3B82F6]\">6. Minor Data Protection</h2><p>For users under 18:</p><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1\"><li>Data is associated with a parent or coach account</li><li>Parents may request review or deletion</li><li>We limit exposure of minor data within team environments only</li></ul></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-athletic font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#3B82F6]\">7. Security Measures</h2><p>We use:</p><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1\"><li>Encrypted connections (HTTPS)</li><li>Role-based access controls</li><li>Secure authentication systems</li></ul><p>However, no system is 100% secure.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-athletic font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#3B82F6]\">8. User Rights</h2><p>Users may:</p><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1\"><li>Request data deletion</li><li>Update account information</li><li>Request a copy of stored personal data</li></ul><p>Contact Braik:<!-- --> <a href=\"mailto:support@apextsgroup.com\" class=\"text-[#60A5FA] underline hover:text-slate-100\">support@apextsgroup.com</a></p></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-athletic font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#3B82F6]\">9. Cookies &amp; Tracking</h2><p>Braik may use:</p><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1\"><li>Session cookies</li><li>Authentication tokens</li><li>Basic analytics tools</li></ul><p>We do not use invasive third-party advertising trackers.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-athletic font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#3B82F6]\">10. Changes to Policy</h2><p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Continued use constitutes acceptance.</p></div><div class=\"mt-8 border-t border-white/20 pt-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-3\"><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"rounded-md bg-[#3B82F6] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-50 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed hover:bg-[#2563EB]\">Mark as reviewed</button><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-300\">Scroll near the bottom of this policy to enable review.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"border-t border-[#E5E7EB] bg-white py-12\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-8\"><div><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center\"><img alt=\"Braik Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"480\" height=\"480\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-[4.5rem] w-auto cursor-default object-contain object-left\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 200px, 240px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fbraik-logo.webp&amp;w=16&amp;q=90 16w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbraik-logo.webp&amp;w=32&amp;q=90 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbraik-logo.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=90 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbraik-logo.webp&amp;w=64&amp;q=90 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbraik-logo.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=90 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbraik-logo.webp&amp;w=128&amp;q=90 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbraik-logo.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=90 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbraik-logo.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=90 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbraik-logo.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=90 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbraik-logo.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=90 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbraik-logo.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=90 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbraik-logo.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=90 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbraik-logo.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=90 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fbraik-logo.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=90 1920w, /_next/im